; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Detail</strong></p><p class=\"ace-line\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 16px;\">Engine <span data-variable=\"agentName\" variablename=\"agentName\" data-system-variable=\"true\" class=\"system-variable\" contenteditable=\"false\">{agentName}</span> has gone offline. Please handle this in time. The <span data-variable=\"taskCount\" variablename=\"taskCount\" data-system-variable=\"true\" class=\"system-variable\" contenteditable=\"false\">{taskCount}</span> tasks running on this engine will be rescheduled to other available engines.</p><p class=\"ace-line\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 16px 0 4px 0; margin-top: 16px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Alarm Time</strong></p><p class=\"ace-line\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 16px;\"><span data-variable=\"alarmDate\" variablename=\"alarmDate\" data-system-variable=\"true\" class=\"system-variable\" contenteditable=\"false\">{alarmDate}</span></p><hr style=\"height: 1px; background: #f3f4f6; border: none; margin: 24px 0;\"><p class=\"ace-line\" style=\"color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; text-align: center; margin: 16px 0 0 0;\"><em style=\"font-style: normal;\">This email is sent by TapData</em></p></div>",
